      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description: A simple realistic continuous movie shot. <Picture 1> defines the only woman's identity and costume. <Picture 2> defines the greenhouse architecture. <Picture 3> defines the only small brass lantern. <Picture 4> defines the clean establishing composition, subject placement and scale; follow this composition closely throughout. Exactly one adult woman with the same face, short black bob with bangs, mustard yellow jacket, teal scarf, charcoal trousers and brown boots stands just left of the wooden table. Exactly one UNLIT brass lantern stands upright on the table. The lantern remains switched OFF throughout; its glass chamber is transparent, without a flame or any emitted light. The camera stays fixed at eye level and the entire foreground is clear and unobstructed. All lighting remains constant, soft, diffuse and cool, as in <Picture 4>. From 0 to 3 seconds, she looks down and gently reaches her right hand toward the lantern handle. From 3 to 6 seconds, she grasps the handle, lifts the lantern just 10 centimeters from the tabletop and holds it steady. From 6 to 9 seconds, she lowers it onto its original spot and releases the handle. In the final second she rests her hands naturally and looks at the lantern. Her left hand stays lowered during the action. Natural unhurried motion, correct contact and weight, consistent face, clothes and lantern. The plants and architecture remain still. No camera motion or cuts. No ribbons, no light streaks, no lens flare, no glow effects, no floating particles, no foreground objects, no text, no overlays, no duplicate people or lanterns. Studio backgrounds from the asset images are not visible.\noverall_soundscape: Quiet room tone with very faint distant wind outside the greenhouse, subtle sleeve rustle and one soft metal-on-wood contact as the lantern is placed down. No speech.\nnon_diegetic_music: None.\n",
        1344,
        768,
        243,
        "match"
      ]
